{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgowMAoiniv5iGQCEWGXV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Orange box: \"משיכה לפני הזמן אפשרית, אבל יקרה\". Got it, wait 6 years. After that it's a glossary table, I'm stopping here.\n\n**What I'd tell a friend:** Joining is clearly worth it. At a 30,000 salary I'd put in 750 ₪ a month and my employer would put in 2,250 ₪. If I took it out after 5 years I'd walk away with about 136,457 ₪, after a big tax bite of 64,761 ₪. The page says to wait the full 6 years, because then the money is tax-free. I'm fairly sure. What sold me was the employer's +135,000 ₪ against my own 45,000 ₪.\n\n**How it went:**\n- **What I read, in order:**\n  - The heading \"קרן השתלמות\" at the top. I scrolled past the long \"מה זה\" text.\n  - The calculator. My 30,000 was already in the salary box. I looked at the big bar numbers from the right: 136,457, then −64,761, then +21,218, then +135,000, then 45,000.\n  - The red \"לפני 6 שנים: מס\" over the small bar chart, and the heading \"מושכים את הכסף אחרי 5 שנים\".\n  - The fee line comparing 0.7% and 0.19%. The gap is only about 1,700 ₪.\n  - The \"כשעוברות 6 שנים\" card.\n  - The fees table, which says \"עד 2%\".\n  - The orange box saying \"משיכה לפני הזמן... יקרה\".\n- **What I skipped:** all the grey notes under the chart, \"שווה לדעת\", \"מי מציע ומי מפקח\", the tax section, \"סיכונים ומה לא מוגן\" and the glossary table. I never opened the 5th screen.\n- **Words I didn't get:** \"הפקדה מוטבת\", \"הרווח הריאלי\", \"ותק\", \"קופת גמל להשקעה\", \"תקרה\".\n- **Where I hesitated:**\n  - The calculator showed 5 years without my asking, so the first number I saw was the early-withdrawal one, with tax taken off. I didn't tap year 6 to see the tax-free amount. The page never gives me that number in shekels.\n  - I'm not sure how the 15,712 ₪ ceiling hits me on a 30,000 salary. It sounds like part of my employer's money gets taxed anyway, but I didn't read that part.\n  - The page doesn't tell me which company or track to pick, or what to actually do first."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3619,"cache_read_input_tokens":15892,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3619},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d0c90835-2281-4041-a591-b21a91a03526","uuid":"e9efecd9-4d6f-4a57-ab6a-89a5bbc34a8e","timestamp":"2026-11-07T17:10:06.618Z","request_id":"req_011CgowMAbpej1XqbCK95hXT"}
